---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Tooly-AI in accordance with GDPR."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top:5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;max-width:680px">

    <h1 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:3rem;font-size:0.9rem">In accordance with GDPR · Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem">1. Controller</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8">
        Yilcay Birinci · <a href="mailto:yilcay.b@gmail.com" style="color:var(--accent)">yilcay.b@gmail.com</a><br/>
        (Full address in <a href="/impressum" style="color:var(--accent)">Legal Notice</a>)
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem">2. Data collected</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
        This website only collects data you actively provide:
      </p>
      <ul style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:2;padding-left:1.5rem">
        <li><strong style="color:var(--text)">Newsletter:</strong> Email address (via Formspree)</li>
        <li><strong style="color:var(--text)">Tool submission:</strong> Tool name, URL, category, optional email</li>
        <li><strong style="color:var(--text)">Server logs:</strong> IP address, date/time, browser type (Vercel)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem">3. Third-party services</h2>

      <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.5rem">Vercel (Hosting)</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
        This website is hosted by Vercel Inc. Vercel processes server logs (IP, timestamps).
        Privacy policy: <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent)">vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy</a>
      </p>

      <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.5rem">Formspree (Forms)</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
        Newsletter and submission forms are processed via Formspree.
        Your submitted data is forwarded to Formspree.
        Privacy policy: <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent)">formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy</a>
      </p>

      <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:0.5rem">Google Fonts</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8">
        This website loads fonts from Google Fonts. Your IP address is transmitted to Google.
        We recommend using a browser with caching enabled (fonts are stored locally after the first load).
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem">4. Cookies</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8">
        This website does not set any tracking cookies.
        Vercel and Formspree may set technically necessary cookies.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem">5. Your rights (GDPR Art. 15–21)</h2>
      <ul style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:2;padding-left:1.5rem">
        <li>Right of access to stored data</li>
        <li>Right to rectification of inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Right to erasure ("right to be forgotten")</li>
        <li>Right to object to processing</li>
        <li>Right to data portability</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.88rem;margin-top:1rem">
        Requests: <a href="mailto:yilcay.b@gmail.com" style="color:var(--accent)">yilcay.b@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem">6. Affiliate links</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8">
        This website contains affiliate links (marked with 💰).
        Clicking such links may cause third-party tracking cookies to be set on the linked website.
        This is used for commission attribution and occurs on the provider's website.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-dim);text-align:center;margin-top:2rem">
      Questions: <a href="mailto:yilcay.b@gmail.com" style="color:var(--accent)">yilcay.b@gmail.com</a>
      · <a href="/impressum" style="color:var(--accent)">Legal Notice</a>
    </p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
